  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;.....(i)</p><p>Where U = Potential energy</p><p><math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;distance</p><p>Dimensional formula of potential energy,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Dimensional formula of distance,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>From equation (i), we can write</p><p><math><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Dimensional formula of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We can write equation (i) as,</p><p><math><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
